                },
                {
                  "key": "includeOutOfStock",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Hybrid search: a vector ranking (Voyage embeddings in pgvector, only candidates above a minimum similarity) and a Spanish full-text ranking, merged with Reciprocal Rank Fusion. When embeddings are unavailable it answers with text results only and `mode: \"text\"`. Products without stock are excluded unless `includeOutOfStock=true`. Limited per user and minute: the 429 response carries a `Retry-After` header."
          }
