            "description": "Quantities are summed when the product is already in the cart. Stock is validated."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create the orders of the cart (one per stand)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fulfillment\": \"delivery\",\n  \"address\": \"Av. Siempre Viva 123\",\n  \"addressRef\": \"Portón verde, frente a la panadería\",\n  \"note\": \"Tocar el timbre\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_URL}}/cart/checkout",
              "host": [
                "{{API_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "cart",
                "checkout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Runs in a transaction: validates stock, creates **one order per stand** with products in the cart (all sharing a `checkoutId`), decrements stock and empties the cart. If any product lacks stock nothing is created. `delivery` requires `address` and `addressRef`; `pickup` ignores them. `contactPhone` defaults to the profile phone. Each seller is notified with `order:new` (and `stock:low`). 400: invalid delivery data, empty cart or no stock."
          }
        },
