            "description": "Orders grouped by purchase (`checkoutId`), newest first, one order per stand. Answers 400 when the user has no orders."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List the orders of my stand",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_URL}}/order/seller/mine",
              "host": [
                "{{API_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "order",
                "seller",
                "mine"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get one of my orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_URL}}/order/:id",
              "host": [
                "{{API_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "order",
                ":id"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change the status of an order",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"confirmed\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_URL}}/order/:id/status",
              "host": [
                "{{API_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "order",
                ":id",
                "status"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Allowed steps: pending -> paid | confirmed | cancelled; paid -> confirmed | cancelled; confirmed -> shipped | cancelled; shipped -> delivered. Anything else is 409; delivered and cancelled are final. Cancelling needs a `reason` (400) and gives the stock back in the same transaction. A seller can only update the orders of their own stand (403); an admin can force any change (recorded as forced). Every change is written to the order history, emails the buyer and emits `order:status` (with the reason)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel my order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Me equivoqué de producto\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_URL}}/order/:id/cancel",
              "host": [
                "{{API_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "order",
                ":id",
                "cancel"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "The buyer cancels their own order while it is `pending` or `paid` (before the seller confirms it). The stock goes back to the products and the seller is notified. An order already paid is not refunded: it is arranged with the seller. 404: not my order. 409: the order can no longer be cancelled by the buyer."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Attach the payment proof of my order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"url\": \"https://example.com/comprobante.jpg\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_URL}}/order/:id/payment-proof",
              "host": [
                "{{API_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "order",
                ":id",
                "payment-proof"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Only for `qr_transfer` orders of the buyer. Allowed when the payment is `unpaid` or `rejected`; the order then becomes `proof_uploaded` and the seller gets `payment:proof`. 404: not my order. 409: wrong method, already paid, proof already waiting or order cancelled."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm or reject the payment of an order",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"reject\",\n  \"reason\": \"El monto no coincide\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{API_URL}}/order/:id/payment",
              "host": [
                "{{API_URL}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "order",
                ":id",
                "payment"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "`confirm` marks the payment `paid` (a `pending` order becomes `paid`): for QR it needs a proof, for cash it is the collection on delivery. `reject` needs a `reason` and only applies to a proof waiting for review. The buyer gets `payment:confirmed` or `payment:rejected`. 403: the order belongs to another stand. 409: invalid transition."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
